{"id":"vergangenheit","lemma":"Vergangenheit","pos":"noun","rank":859,"glosses":["the past (time)","past tense"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈɡaŋənhaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/De-Vergangenheit.ogg/De-Vergangenheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Vergangenheit"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie leben in der Vergangenheit.","en":"You're living in the past.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Wir können die Vergangenheit nicht ändern.","en":"We can't change the past.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to change, to alter"}]},{"text":"Das liegt alles in der Vergangenheit.","en":"That's all in the past.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"everything"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich weiß nichts über seine Vergangenheit.","en":"I don't know anything about his past.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null]},{"text":"Das gehört jetzt alles der Vergangenheit an.","en":"That's all in the past now.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"everything"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"at / on"}]}]}